  "details": "On the first screen, the following element (seen in the MM) are not available on Crowdin or not translated even if approved (ID of strings given):\n\n1. \"Gift to a Friend\" (Unavailable)\n\n2. \"Gift Drop\" (not translated: 130456)\n\n3. \"Community members are participating\" (unavailable)\n\n4. \"View\" (Not translated: 23397)\n\n5. \"You claimed this bundle! Your stickers are ready to use in your Inventory\" (Not translated: 139251)\n\n6. \"Send 5 VRC° or Shop gifts (Exclusive, Avatars, World Stores) to claim this festive Warp Effect.\" (Not translated: 139237)\n\nThe following tooltips are unavailable on Crowdin or untranslated even if approved, linked to the number already on top: \n\n1. \"Go to your friends list to gift VRC+\" (Unavailable)\n\n2. \"Go to the Gift Drop menu\" (Unavailable)\n\n3. \"Go to the Shop\" (Untranslated: 139211)\n\n4. \"Go to the friend leaderboard\" (Unavailable)\n\nOn the second screen, the following are missing for translation on Crowdin (seen on the QM):\n\nTooltip for the \"Learn More\" button -> \"Learn more about the 2025 Holiday Campaign and how to participate!\"\n\n\"Holiday Gift Event!\" header (if possible)",
